translate italian jamietv_63cf1660:

    # gnd "Oh the show's starting."
    gnd "Oh, sta iniziando lo show."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv.rpy:22
translate italian jamietv_28a9be43:

    # "We sit and watch the show together. It isn't very interesting really."
    "Ci sediamo e guardiamo lo show insieme. In realtà non è molto interessante."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv.rpy:23
translate italian jamietv_dd69b654:

    # "I think about trying to make a move on her, but she sits on her side of the couch and I sit on mine and she never moves any closer or seems very interested in me at all."
    "Penso di provare a fare una mossa con lei, ma lei sta seduta dalla sua parte del divano e io dalla mia, e non si avvicina mai né sembra affatto interessata a me."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv.rpy:24
translate italian jamietv_497776e6:

    # "We chit-chat a little, but nothing interesting really happens."
    "Chiacchieriamo un po', ma in realtà non succede nulla di interessante."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv.rpy:25
translate italian jamietv_6d914513:

    # "When the show is over, she leads me to the front door."
    "Quando lo show finisce, mi accompagna alla porta d’ingresso."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv.rpy:28
translate italian jamietv_a182f186:

    # gnd "Thanks for hanging out with me. It was fun."
    gnd "Grazie per aver passato un po’ di tempo con me. È stato divertente."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv.rpy:29
translate italian jamietv_b7756d1b:

    # gnd "We should do it again sometime."
    gnd "Dovremmo rifarlo qualche volta."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv.rpy:30
translate italian jamietv_5f22bf29:

    # pc "Yeah sure, sounds good."
    pc "Sì, certo, mi sembra una buona idea."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv.rpy:31
translate italian jamietv_36153c03:

    # gnd "Alright, well good night."
    gnd "Va bene, allora buona notte."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv.rpy:32
translate italian jamietv_5c92bc6a:

    # pc "Good night."
    pc "Buona notte."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv.rpy:34
translate italian jamietv_0981f357:

    # "With that, she goes back inside and closes the door and I walk back over my house."
    "Detto questo, lei torna dentro e chiude la porta, mentre io torno a casa mia."

